  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Renforcement et extension des m&#xe9;canismes de redevabilit&#xe9; communautaire dans la province du Lac, Tchad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to reinforce and expand the collective accountability mechanism by increasing the number of information and feedback centers (CIF), training more facilitators, and improving inter-agency communication and coordination. This project is part of the special thematic funding envelope for AAP under the 2024 first round of the underfunded emergencies (UFE) allocations. The project provides life-saving assistance to 450,000 people, including 150,000 women, and 200,000 children.</narrative>
  </description>
